\": 490}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720202123, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hhRT5rrsvLfC5FFvPTqC9VoJowuo\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: Dawn breaking over a pristine golf course. The camera zooms in on a glistening golf club, the Golf Pro X, lying on the dew-kissed grass.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Deep, welcoming voice) \\\"When the game is not just a game, but a way of life... Welcome to the Golf Pro X.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a golfer picking up the club and swinging it. The club gleams in the morning light.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Crafted from the finest materials and designed with meticulous precision...\\\"\\n\\n[Close-up shot of the club's grip, then its shaft and finally the head.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"...the Golf Pro X offers unparalleled performance on the green.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the golfer hitting a ball. The ball soars through the air.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Every swing is a testament to power and precision.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the ball landing perfectly on the green, right next to the hole.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Every shot, a step closer to victory.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the golfer's satisfied smile.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"The Golf Pro X isn't just a golf club. It's your partner on the course, your tool of triumph.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the golfer walking off the course, holding the Golf Pro X.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Experience the perfect blend of style, sophistication, and superior performance. Experience the Golf Pro X.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the Golf Pro X against a stunning golf course backdrop.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Golf Pro X. For those who play to win.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the Golf Pro X logo and tagline: \\\"Elevate Your Game\\\".]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Elevate your game...with Golf Pro X.\\\"\\n\\n[End with a soft, inspiring instrumental music fading out.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: (Whisper) \\\"Golf Pro X.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen goes black.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 385}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720202140, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hhRkYfVf71NCbQhVRiIm1M3zDnXP\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting therapy\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: A panoramic shot of a bustling city with people rushing around.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"In this fast-paced world, we often forget to pause, to breathe, to reflect.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a woman in a crowded office, looking overwhelmed.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"The weight of our responsibilities, the stress of our daily lives, it can all be too much.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shifts to a man sitting alone, looking sad and dejected.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Sometimes, we feel alone in our struggles, lost in our thoughts, unsure of where to turn.\\\"\\n\\n[A montage of people from various walks of life, all looking troubled.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"But remember, you don't have to face it alone.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transitions to a comfortable, welcoming therapy office.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Welcome to Safe Haven Therapy. A space where you can feel heard, understood, and supported.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows a therapist listening attentively to a client.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our team of dedicated, compassionate professionals are here to guide you through your journey of self-discovery and healing.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows various therapeutic activities: art therapy, group therapy, one-on-one counselling.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're dealing with anxiety, depression, stress, grief, or just need someone to talk to, we're here for you.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transitions to clients looking relieved, smiling, and more at peace.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Because everyone deserves a safe space to heal and grow.\\\"\\n\\n[Final scene: The Safe Haven Therapy logo, contact details, and tagline, 'You don't have to face it alone'.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Safe Haven Therapy. You don't have to face it alone.\\\"\\n\\n[End of advert.]\\n\", \"model\": 