e or call us to order yours now.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 464}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720202812, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hhcadB4ZpRQE8D4PU8OoC2rGLyf3\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a car\", \"response\": \"[Scene opens to a sleek, shiny car driving along a scenic coastal road at sunrise]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Introducing the all-new 2023 Vortex Thrust.\\\"\\n\\n[Aerial shot of the car zooming past, the sun shimmering off its sleek body]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"A car that does more than just drive.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the car's interior, revealing high-tech dashboard]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"A hub of innovation, designed with you in mind.\\\"\\n\\n[Close-up of the dashboard showing GPS, music settings and a hands-free phone call in action]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Stay connected, entertained and safe, with our latest smart technology.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the exterior, the car accelerates and overtakes a truck with ease]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Experience power like never before, with our turbocharged engine, delivering thrilling performance.\\\"\\n\\n[The car drives into a city, smoothly navigating through traffic]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"In the city or on the open road, the Vortex Thrust is a joy to drive, with responsive handling and smooth ride.\\\"\\n\\n[As the car stops at a traffic light, a pedestrian admires the car]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"With its aggressive lines and stunning design, you won't just turn heads. You'll drop jaws.\\\"\\n\\n[The car parks in a driveway next to a family home]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"But it's not just about style and speed. The Vortex Thrust is also about family.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the back seats filled with child seats, toys and sports equipment]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Spacious interiors, advanced safety features and comfort that makes every journey a pleasure.\\\"\\n\\n[The scene shifts to night, the car is seen driving on a high