ose-up of the man, sweating and looking frustrated.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Wish you could enjoy your weekend instead?\\n\\n[Scene: The old mower sputters and dies.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Well, now you can!\\n\\n[Scene: The screen splits. On one side, the man continues to struggle with the old mower. On the other side, a shiny new lawnmower with the brand logo appears.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Introducing the new (brand name), the ultimate lawnmower for your perfect garden.\\n\\n[Scene: The man discards the old mower and gleefully approaches the new one.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): With its high-performance engine and advanced blade technology, it cuts through the toughest grass with ease!\\n\\n[Scene: The man effortlessly pushes the new mower, cutting the grass smoothly.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): And with its lightweight design and easy maneuverability, you'll find mowing the lawn a breeze!\\n\\n[Scene: The man nimbly navigates the mower around a tree.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Plus, its eco-friendly technology ensures you're doing your part for the environment too.\\n\\n[Scene: A shot of the mower's exhaust pipe, showing no emissions.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): So why struggle when you can mow with ease?\\n\\n[Scene: The man finishes mowing, looking satisfied. He leans on the new lawnmower, wiping his brow.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): The new (brand name) lawnmower. Making the tough jobs easy, so you can enjoy your perfect garden.\\n\\n[Scene: The camera pans out to show the beautifully mowed lawn and the new lawnmower at the center.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): (Brand name), for the love of your lawn. \\n\\n[Screen fades to black and the brand logo appears.] \\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Available at all leading garden stores. Get yours today!\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 460}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720204303, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hi0dwGbbr21ey6fwMtkvxctmL2Ii\", \"prompt\": \"Write a