s to mind...\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of a pack of our brand dishwasher tablets.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Introducing our brand-new dishwasher tablets...\\\"\\n\\n[SFX: Pack opening with a satisfying click, revealing gleaming dishwasher tablets]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"...Engineered to deliver a powerful clean every time.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a side-by-side comparison: on the left, dirty dishes, and on the right, the same dishes looking immaculate after using our brand dishwasher tablets.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our advanced formula cuts through the toughest grease and grime, leaving your dishes spotlessly clean and shining bright.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a tablet dropped into the dishwasher tray, fizzing as it starts to dissolve.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Just one tablet is all it takes... Pop it in, and let it work its magic.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the dishwasher door closing, then reopening to reveal gleaming dishes, glasses, and cutlery.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And voila! From dirty to dazzling in just one wash.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a mother serving food to her family on gleaming plates.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"So you can focus on creating those perfect family moments, without worrying about the cleanup.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the product with the kitchen in the background.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Try our brand dishwasher tablets today \\u2013 for a clean you can trust.\\\"\\n\\n[Final shot: The product logo, tagline, and a call to action.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our brand \\u2013 Powering your dishwasher, powering your life. Buy now at your nearest store or online.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black, end of the advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 397}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720204430, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hi2g2H79m1vpdx4Q6NYnTMnBbu8j\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a vacuum cleaner\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A happy family playing in a 