hot: The sun setting over the golf course, the club logo appears on screen.]\\n\\nVO: (With a final, inviting tone) Prestige Golf Club - where the lifestyle is as impressive as the golf.\\n\\n[Screen fades to black, with text appearing: \\\"Join Us Today\\\" and the website address.]\\n\\nVO: (In a soft, appealing tone) Join us today and experience the Prestige difference.\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 529}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720205230, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hiFajFSpGL4QolgOnl5iFA3sZWA4\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting therapy\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: A peaceful beach during sunrise. The camera moves towards a woman sitting alone, looking out to sea.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Sometimes, life can feel like a stormy sea; full of unpredictable waves and undercurrents. \\n\\n[Scene transition: The woman is shown struggling to maintain balance on a surfboard amidst rough waves.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Navigating through the struggles and stresses of everyday life can feel overwhelming.\\n\\n[Scene transition: A close-up of the woman\\u2019s face, showing signs of stress and worry.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): You may feel lost, alone, unable to stay afloat.\\n\\n[Scene transition: The woman falls off the surfboard into the water.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): But remember, it\\u2019s okay to seek help. It's okay to ask for support.\\n\\n[Scene transition: The woman is now sitting in a warm and inviting therapy room, speaking to a friendly therapist.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Therapy can provide that support. It's a safe space for you to express your feelings, understand your thoughts, and learn to manage life's waves.\\n\\n[Scene transition: The therapist is seen listening attentively and empathetically.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Our therapists are here to journey with you, offering professional guidance and a non-judgmental ear.\\n\\n[Scene transition: The woman is shown slowly gaining her balance on the surfboard amidst calmer waves.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Step by step, you'll learn to navigate life's challenges, regain your balance, and find your inner strength.\\n\\n[Scene transition: The woman is now surfing confidently on the calm sea, with a smile on her face.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Make the choice today. Choose therapy. Choose a better, healthier you. \\n\\n[Closing scene: The company's logo appears on the screen with contact information.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): Call us or visit our website to schedule an appointment. We're here for you. In the storm, in the calm, always.\\n\\n[End of advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 419}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720205247, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hiFrWjmUs8ZJnlc6GIKmrD03t4sP\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[Open on a pristine landscape with a crystal-clear river rushing through it. A voiceover begins.]\\n\\nVO: (Deep, soothing voice) \\\"Welcome to nature\\u2019s own brewery.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a group of friends around a campfire, laughing and sharing stories.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Where good times are best shared with great company...\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of a frosty beer bottle being opened, the cap flying off.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"...and exceptional beer.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transitions to slow-motion shots of beer being poured into a glass, showcasing its golden color and frothy head.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Introducing [Brand Name] Beer. Brewed with the purest spring water, and the finest locally sourced barley.\\\"\\n\\n[Aerial shot of local barley fields swaying in the wind.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"The secret behind its rich, crisp taste and smooth finish.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of friends clinking beer bottles together in a toast.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"A beer that brings people together, turning good times into unforgettable memories.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of the same group of friends enjoying their