ou.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Various shots of people lifting, each heavier than the last.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Atlas Strength isn't just about lifting weights. It's about lifting each other up, building a community.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Group of people cheering on a lifter as they reach a personal best.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"It's about pushing your limits, breaking barriers, and discovering just how strong you can be.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Close-up of a determined face, grunting and straining as they lift a heavy barbell.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"So, are you ready to redefine strength?\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A triumphant lifter drops the barbell, throws their arms up in celebration.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Join Atlas Strength weightlifting class today and unleash your inner Titan!\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: The Atlas Strength logo appears on the screen.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Atlas Strength - Discover the Power Within.\\\"\\n\\n[Background Music Fades]\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 426}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720205730, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hiNeb9a7GLIwAAGFLxY97GwSKbBp\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: Aerial view of a pristine golf course, sunrise peeking over the horizon]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Welcome, to the unparalleled world of [Golf Club Name].\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A golfer tees off, the ball soars through the clear blue sky]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Where each swing is a harmony of precision, power, and elegance.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Close-up of the lush green fairways]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Where the fairways are meticulously crafted, offering a unique challenge and an unforgettable experience.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Golf balls falling into the hole, high-five between players]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Where the thrill of the game meets the joy of camaraderie.\\\"\\n\\n[Aerial view of the club house