ller)\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Connect with friends, challenge the world, and enjoy a vast library of games with our ever-growing online platform!\\\"\\n\\n(Video: Screen showing a friend list, multiplayer gameplay, and a carousel of game titles)\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"But that's not all! The ProPlay X900 also doubles as an entertainment hub, allowing you to stream your favorite movies and shows in breath-taking 4K.\\\"\\n\\n(Video: Quick switch from game mode to streaming apps like Netflix, Amazon Prime, and YouTube)\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"Are you ready to redefine your gaming experience? Don't just play, ProPlay! The ProPlay X900, where the games never end!\\\"\\n\\n(Video: The ProPlay X900 logo appears on screen, and then we see a montage of gamers enjoying the console, laughing, and high-fiving)\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\\"ProPlay X900. Play like a Pro.\\\"\\n\\n(Video: End frame with the product, price, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" button)\\n\\n[Background Music fades out]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 467}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720207198, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hilKFCZF5yP9yxFr3Ca56y7euI8J\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a social network\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"In a world where staying connected means everything, we bring you a platform designed to keep you closer than ever. Introducing 'SocialSphere' - Your world, your people!\\\"\\n\\n[Video: A montage of diverse people of all ages scrolling through their phones, laughter, and bonding]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"SocialSphere is more than just a social network. It\\u2019s a vibrant community where you can share your life, opinions, dreams, and creativity.\\\"\\n\\n[Video: People posting pictures, sharing status updates, live streaming, and creating content]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Connect with friends, family, and those who inspire you. Share photos, videos, stories, and make unforgettable memories.\\\"\\n\\n