 OUT]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 456}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720207347, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hinjjshV8EhNjQu8icozhebPXa2b\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting protein powder\", \"response\": \"[Background music starts playing: Upbeat and energetic]\\n\\n[Scene: A gym filled with enthusiastic people working out]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Are you looking to fuel your workout, recover faster, and boost your strength? Well, we have the solution for you.\\\"\\n\\n[Cuts to a shot of the product: a tub of protein powder]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Introducing our Premium Protein Powder.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A hand scooping protein powder and mixing it in a shaker]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our protein powder isn't just any protein powder. It's packed with high-quality protein, essential amino acids, and vital nutrients.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Close up shot of the protein powder dissolving in water]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Easy to dissolve, smooth to drink, and deliciously tasty.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Split screen showing different flavours of the protein powder]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Available in a range of mouth-watering flavours like Chocolate Fudge, French Vanilla, and Strawberry Delight.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A person drinking protein shake after workout and looking satisfied]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're looking to bulk up, slim down, or simply improve your fitness, our protein powder gives you the power to achieve your goals.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Before and after photos of people who used the product]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"See the difference, feel the change. Join the thousands of fitness enthusiasts who trust us.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: The product with the logo and tagline]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Premium Protein Powder - Unleash Your Inner Strength.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: The product with a call to action]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"So, what are you waiting for? Get yo