ace the journey to a better you.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 430}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720207739, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hiu3L4d5zAo0QZ6CHREwBvku7kcn\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat, energetic music begins]\\n\\n[Scene opens with a pan shot of an upbeat, lit-up gym, where people are seen lifting weights.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Are you ready to redefine your limits? To sculpt your body? To gain the strength you never knew you had?\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of a barbell being lifted.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Introducing 'Power Lift' \\u2013 the ultimate weightlifting class designed to transform you!\\\"\\n\\n[Switch to a montage of men and women of different ages and fitness levels, lifting weights and showing determination.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Don't be fooled. This isn't just about lifting weights. It's about lifting your spirit...your confidence...your life!\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows a trainer instructing a class, demonstrating the correct form and technique.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our expert trainers will guide you every step of the way. Ensuring you master the form, technique, and most importantly - safety.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a participant high-fiving the trainer after successfully completing a lift.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"At Power Lift, we believe in celebrating every milestone, no matter how small.\\\"\\n\\n[Switch to a shot of participants laughing and chatting after the class.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"It's not just about the workout, it's about the community. A place where you'll meet like-minded people, who'll inspire you, motivate you and push you to be your best.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen shows before and after pictures of people who have transformed their bodies.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"See real results, feel real power, experience real change!\\\