forting]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our team of professional therapists is here to walk with you, providing a safe space for you to share, heal, and grow.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to montage of various therapists comforting clients]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're dealing with stress, anxiety, depression, relationship issues, or just need someone to talk to, we're here for you.\\\"\\n\\n[Show the Therapy Connect app on a smartphone, with features like booking a session, chatting with a therapist, and mental health resources]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"With Therapy Connect, you can access therapy anytime, anywhere, right at your fingertips. You can schedule sessions at your convenience, choose from a variety of therapy methods, and even chat with your therapist in real time.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to clients looking happier and more relaxed after therapy sessions]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Remember, it's not about 'fixing' you. It's about helping you understand yourself better, cope with life's challenges, and ultimately, thrive.\\\"\\n\\n[Closing shot: Therapy Connect logo and contact details]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Take a step towards better mental health today. Therapy Connect - Your Journey, Our Support. Visit our website or download the app to get started.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 467}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720207794, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hiuwQOHZ4dR5CVaU7C4yO45d0B5h\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A golden sunset over a picturesque countryside. A soft, acoustic guitar starts playing in the background.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"When the day is done and the world slows down\\u2026.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of a cold beer bottle with droplets of condensation slowly trickling down.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"It\\u2019s time to unwind with the warming embrace of our premium beer.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to