age of golfers of different ages and genders]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"We're a community that brings together golf lovers of all ages, skills, and backgrounds. Here, you're not just a member; you're part of the family.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a view of the clubhouse, people chatting, laughing, clinking glasses]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"After a round, unwind at our sophisticated clubhouse, enjoy a fine dining experience or relax at the bar - offering stunning panoramic views of the course.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a view of the pro shop, golf carts, and teaching facilities]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Our state-of-the-art facilities include a fully stocked pro shop, electric golf carts, and teaching facilities with PGA professionals.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to an overhead drone shot of the entire golf course]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Nestled in the heart of nature, Fairway Pines is more than just a golf club; it's a retreat from the everyday hustle.\\\"\\n\\n[The video concludes with the logo of Fairway Pines Golf Club, contact details, and the tagline]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Fairway Pines Golf Club - Elevate your game.\\\"\\n\\n[End with uplifting music]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Join us today and discover the Fairway Pines experience.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black with website details and the invitation to visit]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Visit our website or call us to schedule your visit. Fairway Pines Golf Club, where golf dreams come true.\\\"\\n\\n[Ends]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 466}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720208282, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hj2ooMBtuE2VbLtUiYBe98FXUR6z\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting therapy\", \"response\": \"[Soft, soothing music playing]\\n\\n[Opening shot: A woman sitting alone on the edge of her bed, looking overwhelmed]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Sometimes, life can feel like a storm..\\\"\\n\\n[A quick montage of stress-inducing scenes: a demanding boss, a crying baby, overdue bills]\\n\\nNARRA