 \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 470}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720209327, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hjJfnypFny8nzLLqdW6EeiHFguvi\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a yoga class\", \"response\": \"[Scene: A peaceful, open space with natural light, people of different ages and genders are shown performing yoga poses on mats]\\n\\nVoiceover (enthusiastically): \\\"Are you looking to rejuvenate your mind, body, and soul?\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene transitions to a close-up of an instructor demonstrating a yoga pose]\\n\\nVoiceover (soothing tone): \\\"Welcome to Tranquil Path Yoga classes.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A montage of different people performing yoga, with close-ups of their focused faces and then smiling into the camera]\\n\\nVoiceover (inspiring tone): \\\"Join us in a journey towards self-discovery and inner peace.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Instructor helping a student correct their pose]\\n\\nVoiceover (encouraging tone): \\\"Whether you're a beginner or an experienced yogi, our certified instructors tailor the session for everyone, ensuring you get the most out of each class.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Group of people laughing and interacting after class]\\n\\nVoiceover (friendly tone): \\\"Enjoy the camaraderie of a supportive community that motivates you to achieve your wellness goals.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Student visibly looking more relaxed and happy after yoga]\\n\\nVoiceover (calm tone): \\u201cExperience the benefits of improved flexibility, strength, posture, and stress reduction.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: A serene outside view of the yoga studio]\\n\\nVoiceover (enthusiastically): \\\"Located in the heart of the city, our studio offers you a peaceful sanctuary to escape the daily grind.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Close-up of a woman rolling out her yoga mat]\\n\\nVoiceover (inviting tone): \\\"So unroll your mat, breathe in positivity, and exhale the stress.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Logo of Tranquil Path Yoga classes and contact details]\\n\\nVoiceover (cheerful tone): \\\"Tranquil Pat