ctric drill, showing its sleek design and features.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Sleek, durable, and user-friendly, our electric drills are designed to make your work easier and more efficient.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Man drilling smoothly through various materials like wood, metal, and concrete.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're working on wood, metal, or concrete, our drills have the power to get the job done.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Close up shot of the drill's battery.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"With our long-lasting, fast-charging batteries, you'll spend less time waiting and more time working.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Man easily swapping drill bits.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And with our easy-to-change drill bits, you can switch tasks in seconds!\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Drill being used in a dark area, its built-in LED light illuminating the work area.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Even working in low-light conditions is a breeze with our built-in LED light.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: The drill being dropped but still working perfectly.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And don't worry about rough handling; our drills are built to withstand tough conditions.\\\"\\n\\n[Final Scene: The electric drill with the company logo prominently displayed.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our electric drills - because we believe that your tools should work as hard as you do.\\\"\\n\\n[Ends with the company's tagline and contact details.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Get your electric drill today! Visit our website or call us at...\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black, end of advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 402}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720210661, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hjfBaCanG7UUiBA7irxIhRXYkbwY\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: A cute baby sleeping peacefully in a crib. The room is adorned with soft toys and a calm lullaby is playing in the background]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceov