More.\\\"\\n\\n[The advert fades out, leaving the BuildMore logo and tagline on screen.]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Visit us in-store or online at www.buildmore.com today.\\\"\\n\\n[End of the advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 455}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720210987, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hjkRp1pd1T415f4ZRXYIdWiz1F0x\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a supermarket\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"When life gets busy, you need a one-stop solution for all your grocery needs. Introducing... SuperFresh Supermarket!\\\" \\n\\n[Visual: An aerial view of SuperFresh Supermarket with a bustling parking lot.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"From farm fresh produce to pantry staples, and from household necessities to gourmet treats...\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Quick shots of vibrant fresh fruits, vegetables, packed goods, cleaning supplies, and gourmet chocolates.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"SuperFresh Supermarket has everything you need under one roof!\\\" \\n\\n[Visual: Aerial view of diverse sections inside the supermarket.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"We pride ourselves in serving our customers with the freshest and highest quality products.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Staff restocking shelves with fresh produce, close-up shots of high-quality products.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And we don\\u2019t just stop there. At SuperFresh, we believe quality should be affordable.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Price tags showing discounted prices, customers looking surprised and happy.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"That\\u2019s why we offer everyday low prices and fantastic weekly deals.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: A family shopping, placing items in their cart, smiling.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you\\u2019re planning a BBQ party, or just doing your weekly grocery run...\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Customers picking up BBQ supplies, a mother with a list checking off items.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \