ucts.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're a seasoned pro or a DIY beginner, at Build-It-Right, we've got aisle after aisle of everything you need.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Close-ups of power tools, paint, gardening supplies, lighting fixtures, kitchen and bathroom items.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"From power tools, paints, gardening supplies, to lighting, kitchen and bathroom items, our selection is second to none.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Friendly store associates help customers.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And it's not just about our vast assortment of products. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always on hand to answer your questions, guide you through tricky projects, and make sure you find exactly what you're looking for.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Customer at the checkout counter, smiling and satisfied.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"At Build-It-Right, we believe in making your DIY journey as smooth and enjoyable as possible, so you can create something you're truly proud of.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene: Montage of people successfully completing DIY projects at home.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"So why wait? Start that project you've been dreaming of today.\\\"\\n\\n[Final Scene: The Build-It-Right logo appears on screen.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Visit Build-It-Right and let's bring your vision to life. Build-It-Right - Where DIY dreams become reality.\\\"\\n\\n[Background Music Fades Out]\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 421}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720211454, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hjryTTiP0UjtQSd2MjZvSq9J0zld\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a supermarket\", \"response\": \"[Background music starts]\\n\\n[Camera opens to a busy, vibrant supermarket bustling with customers. Fresh produce, neatly stacked shelves, and happy customers are seen. The camera zooms in on the supermarket's sign - \\\"FreshMart.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Welcome to FreshMart, your one-stop-sh