 become stronger...\\n\\n[Cut to: A shot of a woman flexing her biceps]\\n\\nV.O: ...leaner...\\n\\n[Cut to: A shot of a man showing his abs]\\n\\nV.O: ...and healthier than ever before.\\n\\n[Cut to: A shot of the Protein Power tub]\\n\\nV.O: It's not just protein \\u2013 it's power. \\n\\n[Cut to: A shot of a man and woman, both looking fit and happy]\\n\\nV.O: So why wait? Give your body the boost it needs...\\n\\n[Cut to: A shot of the Protein Power logo]\\n\\nV.O: ...with Protein Power. \\n\\n[Cut to: A shot of the protein powder being scooped into a tub]\\n\\nV.O: Protein Power \\u2013 Fuel Your Strength. \\n\\n[The music fades out, and the screen goes black]\\n\\nV.O: Available in stores and online now.\\n\\n[End of the advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 479}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720211885, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hjyvFRw8Wx8mSDdLKb0zJBelsLoG\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weight loss programme\", \"response\": \"[Soft uplifting music playing]\\n\\n[Scene 1: A woman looking in the mirror, not happy with her reflection]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Are you tired of fad diets that promise fast results but leave you feeling drained and unsatisfied?\\\"\\n\\n[Scene 2: The same woman trying on clothes that don't fit]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Are you struggling with weight loss, feeling like you are constantly fighting a losing battle?\\\"\\n\\n[Scene 3: Close-up of the woman looking frustrated]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"We understand your struggle, and we have a solution.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene 4: Transition to bright, inspiring images of the same woman looking happier and healthier]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Introducing our comprehensive weight loss programme - [Product Name].\\\"\\n\\n[Scene 5: Close-up of the programme logo]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Unlike other diet plans, [Product Name] is designed to provide lasting results.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene 6: Montage of healthy meals,