Narrator (Voiceover): \\\"Find your balance. Find your strength. Find your peace.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: Logo of Serenity Yoga Studio, details about classes and contact information]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Serenity Yoga Studio. Your journey to wellness starts here. Join us today.\\\"\\n\\n[Ends with a soft gong sound]\\n\\n[Screen fades to black]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 342}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720212749, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hkCrzK804KAzKI1Ruj1gZv7zN40c\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Are you tired of the same old boring workouts? Are you looking to challenge yourself and push your limits? Well, we have the perfect solution for you!\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Montage of people lifting weights, sweating, and looking motivated]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Welcome to Iron Grip Weightlifting Classes, the ultimate fitness experience that will transform your body and mind!\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Class instructor cheering on a member as they lift weights]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our classes are designed for everyone, from beginners who have never lifted a weight, to experienced powerlifters. Our certified trainers will guide you every step of the way.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Instructor demonstrating proper weightlifting technique]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"We prioritize your safety, ensuring that you learn the correct form and techniques to prevent injuries and maximize your workouts.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: People of various ages, genders, and body types lifting weights]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"At Iron Grip, we believe that weightlifting is for everyone, regardless of age, gender, or fitness level. We are a community that supports and encourages each other to reach our goals.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Members high-fiving each other, smiling, and celebrating their progress]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"With us