or (Voiceover): \\\"The comfortable yet firm grip reduces hand fatigue and increases stability, giving you the confidence to play your best game, every game.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the ball landing perfectly on the green.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're a seasoned pro or a weekend warrior, the ProTitanium Golf Club delivers the performance you need to take your game to new heights.\\\"\\n\\n[Final shot of the golf club against the backdrop of a beautiful sunset on the golf course.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Experience the game of golf like never before. ProTitanium Golf Club - Because every swing matters.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black with the ProTitanium logo and tagline: \\\"Raise your game.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Visit your nearest golf store or our website to purchase the ProTitanium Golf Club. Raise your game, today.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 410}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720212787, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hkDTiyE65bNZ05i13Tf6vt1bZol4\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting therapy\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: A busy city street. People walking hurriedly, honking horns, crowded sidewalks.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"Life is a constant rush. We're always moving, always pushing, always striving...\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a person sitting alone in a dimly lit room, looking stressed.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"But for some, the rush becomes too much.\\\"\\n\\n[The person rubs their temples, looking frustrated.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"The stress, the pressure, the weight of the world...it can be overwhelming.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the person looking at a picture of a happy family, tears welling up in their eyes.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"But what if...we could help you navigate through it all?\\\"\\n\\n[Scene changes to a warm, welcoming office. A friendly therapist smiles, gesturing to a comfortable chair.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Welcome to T