ct tool for all your drilling needs.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows the man using the electric drill, looking satisfied.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you\\u2019re a DIY enthusiast or a professional tradesperson, our electric drills are designed to make your work easy, fast, and efficient.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows a montage of the electric drill being used in various settings \\u2013 a home project, a workshop, a construction site.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our drills are lightweight, durable, and equipped with the latest technology for precision and control.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows close-ups of the drill features - the speed control, the ergonomic handle, the powerful motor.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"From installing shelves to building furniture, our electric drill ensures you get the job done right, the first time.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows before and after shots of projects made easier with the electric drill.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Say goodbye to the hassle and hello to efficiency.\\\"\\n\\n[Final Scene: The man looking satisfied with his completed project.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Upgrade your toolbox today with our advanced electric drills. Because at [Your Company Name], we believe in empowering you to create more.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene fades to black with the company logo and tagline.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"[Your Company Name] \\u2013 Powering your creativity.\\\"\\n\\n[End of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 398}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720213624, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hkQywfNUjDtCY0qDHMg6OMvLer4z\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A baby laughing and playing on a soft carpet]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): (Cheerful, warm tone) \\\"Meet little Sophie. A bundle of joy, a powerhouse of energy, always ready for a new adventure.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: Baby Sophie crawling around, giggling and playing with her toys]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceov