ore. Feel every heartbeat, every explosion, every victory.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the console's gamepad, showcasing its ergonomic design.]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Take control with our most comfortable and intuitive gamepad yet, designed to keep you playing for hours without strain.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut back to the console, this time with the spotlight focusing on its logo.]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"And with built-in Wi-Fi, the Apex XG Console connects you to a global community of players, ready to challenge your skills and make every game an adventure.\\\"\\n\\n[As the narrator speaks, the screen shows a montage of online multiplayer games.]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"The Apex XG Console. Power. Precision. Performance.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a black screen with the console's logo, the release date, and the tagline.]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Unleash your potential. Coming soon.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 382}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720214169, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hkZlosHI1NptY4ivRSUv2cD00diO\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a social network\", \"response\": \"[Soft, uplifting background music playing]\\n\\n[VIDEO: A montage of diverse people using their smartphones, tablets, and computers in various settings \\u2013 coffee shops, parks, offices, and at home.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"In an increasingly connected world, it's never been more important to feel part of a community.\\\"\\n\\n[VIDEO: Shots of people smiling at their screens, clearly engaged and happy.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"Introducing \\u2018ConnectUs \\u2013 the social network designed to bring people together, no matter where you are.\\\"\\n\\n[VIDEO: Screen recording of the ConnectUs app \\u2013 showing its sleek interface, user-friendly features, and a variety of content.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (Voiceover): \\\"On ConnectUs, you can connect with old friends, meet new ones, join groups that share your interest