apes, and sizes practicing yoga]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our classes are designed to accommodate all levels - from beginners who are just starting their journey, to advanced yogis who want to deepen their practice.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene of a yoga instructor assisting a beginner with their pose. Then, a scene of an advanced student performing a complex yoga pose]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our experienced, friendly, and certified yoga instructors guide you through each pose, ensuring your practice is safe, effective, and enjoyable.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene of a smiling yoga instructor demonstrating a pose to a class]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Whether you're looking to improve flexibility, build strength, reduce stress, or just have a bit of 'me' time - our classes cater to your needs.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene showing various benefits of yoga - a student stretching, another holding a strength pose, a tranquil student meditating]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And now, we have a special offer! Sign up for our monthly membership and get your first class for free!\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transitions to the Serenity Yoga Studio logo, special offer details appear on screen]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"So why wait? Start your yoga journey with Serenity Yoga Studio today!\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows contact details and website address]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Visit our website or call us to book your first class. Serenity Yoga Studio - where inner peace begins.\\\"\\n\\n[Upbeat music fades out, end of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 383}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720214200, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hkaGsZzNsfJsTBXmyTgXM0A9eh1A\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\n[Scene 1: A close-up shot of a weight being lifted]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Looking to challenge yourself? To push your limits?\\\"\\n\\n[Scene 2: A middle-aged woman doing deadlifts, a youn