rt]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 406}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720215546, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hkvy15oN5CSBrTob1dDxL1aJULd3\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a social network\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A vibrant montage of everyday people from different walks of life using their phones and computers.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"In a world that\\u2019s more connected than ever, it\\u2019s amazing how disconnected we can sometimes feel.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: A young woman sitting in a cafe alone, scrolling through her phone.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Whether we\\u2019re miles apart from our loved ones, or just feeling a little bit lost in the crowd\\u2026\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: A young man in an office, surrounded by people, but looking isolated.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"We all need a space where we can truly connect.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen goes black, and then the logo of the social network appears.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Welcome to ConnectHub.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: A montage of the social network\\u2019s features, including user profiles, photo sharing, group chats, etc.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"ConnectHub is a social network that\\u2019s all about real connections. Share your moments, your passions, your ideas. Rekindle old friendships, make new ones, join groups that share your interests.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: A montage of people smiling at their screens, typing messages, sharing photos, joining video calls.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"With ConnectHub, you\\u2019re never alone. Whether you\\u2019re reaching out to a friend, joining a community, or just browsing through shared moments from around the world...\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: An older woman video calling her grandkids, a group of friends laughing in a group chat, a young man finding a group related to his hobbies.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"You\\u2019re part of a global family. A place where everyone belongs.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to: The logo of the social network again.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"ConnectHub