rs on screen.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): (Conclusively) \\\"FreshMart Supermarket - Where quality meets affordability! Your satisfaction is our priority.\\\"\\n\\n[Background Music: Fades Out]\\n\\n[Screen: \\u201cVisit our website www.freshmart.com or download our app. Open daily from 7 am to 10 pm.\\u201d]\\n\\n[End of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 461}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720216668, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hlE40tRq89OPWtvhC5n2HeOIRI0x\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a clothes shop\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing softly in the background]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Do you crave style? Do you desire the latest trends? Look no further, welcome to 'Fashion Forward'!\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: The vibrant exterior of a stylish, trendy clothes shop]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Nestled in the heart of the city, Fashion Forward is the ultimate destination for fashion lovers.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Swanky interiors of the shop, racks filled with colourful clothes, accessories, shoes, and more]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our wide variety of clothing caters to every style. Whether it's chic, boho, or classic, we've got you covered.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Montage of various clothes, close-ups of fabric, prints, and textures]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"With new arrivals every week, there's always something fresh and exciting waiting for you.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Stylish clothes on mannequins, staff stocking up new arrivals]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"But it's not just about the clothes. It's about the experience.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Friendly staff helping customers, a spacious changing room, comfortable seating area]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our dedicated team of fashion experts is always ready to help you find your perfect fit and style.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Staff helping a customer, suggesting clothes, customer trying on clothes and looking satisfied]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"And the 