O): \\\"With its cordless design, PowerBlast Pro gives you the freedom to work anywhere, anytime.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Worker climbing a ladder with the drill, no cord to tangle or trip over]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Powerful, 20V lithium-ion battery provides longer run time and more work per charge.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Battery indicator on the drill showing full charge]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Two-speed transmission, for optimal speed and torque control.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Close-up of the speed switch being easily adjusted]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"And a keyless chuck for easy bit changes.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Worker quickly changing drill bits]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"The PowerBlast Pro Electric Drill - it's not just a tool, it's your partner in construction.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: Worker holding up the drill, a satisfied smile on their face]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"Get your PowerBlast Pro Electric Drill today and redefine your drilling experience.\\\"\\n\\n[Visual: The drill with the price and contact information]\\n\\nNarrator (VO): \\\"PowerBlast Pro Electric Drill - Power in your hands.\\\"\\n\\n[Background music fades, screen goes black]\\n\\n[End of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 403}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720216825, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hlGbjZFVEd7XZTSh3D34Fa98XcQi\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\n[Scene fades in to a busy mom juggling household chores, her job, and a fussy baby]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O.): \\\"Life as a mom is a balancing act. You have a million things on your mind, and the last thing you need to worry about is a leaky nappy.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a pack of our brand nappies]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O.): \\\"Introducing our improved brand of nappies, the ultimate solution for modern moms.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene shows a mom easily changing the baby\\u2019s nappy]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O.): \\\"Designed with a super absorbent core, our nappies ensure maximum