le being lit, the flame flickering]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Presenting our exclusive range of handcrafted candles.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transition: Different candles are shown, all with unique designs, colors, and sizes]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Each one, a testament of our commitment to craftsmanship and quality.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transition: A woman seen relaxing in a bathtub, surrounded by candles. A couple enjoying a candlelit dinner. A person reading by the soft glow of a candle]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Perfect for creating a relaxing atmosphere after a long day, setting a romantic mood for a dinner date, or simply enjoying a quiet evening of reading.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transition: A hand is seen picking up a candle, followed by a closeup shot of the candle being sniffed]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Infused with an array of enchanting fragrances, our candles don't just light up your space, they stir your senses.\\\"\\n\\n[Scene transition: A series of shots showing candles being packaged and shipped]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Delivered straight to your doorstep, our candles are the perfect gift for yourself or a loved one.\\\"\\n\\n[Final Scene: The brand logo appears onscreen along with the website and contact details]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Experience the magic of our candles. Visit our website or call us to place your order now.\\\"\\n\\n[End Scene: The screen fades to black as the soft, soothing music fades out]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Transform your moments into memories, with our candles.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 392}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720217685, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hlUTMl4HmDmiRmjANZNE7l9WEwRB\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting bubble bath\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\n[Scene 1: A workaholic woman is seen coming home late from work, looking exhausted]\\n\\nNarrator (V.O): \\\"Life can be stressful, can't 