 curtains.\\\"\\n\\n[End of Advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 388}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720217717, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hlUzYeRYuSH2LxrdPX77qRYF0i9h\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting electric drills\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: A close-up shot of a person's hand holding an electric drill, drilling into a piece of wood.]\\n\\nVoice-over (VO): \\\"For every project, every task, every challenge... there's one tool that you can always rely on.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of different scenarios: A man assembling a bookshelf, a woman creating a DIY art piece, a professional contractor at a construction site.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Introducing our latest line of electric drills.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to show a sleek, modern electric drill with a digital screen and advanced features.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Designed for power, built for performance.\\\"\\n\\n[Close-up shots of the drill's features: The torque settings, the chuck tightening, the battery sliding in.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"With advanced torque settings, a keyless chuck for easy bit changes, and a long-lasting battery, this isn\\u2019t just a tool, it's your partner in creation.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the drill in action: A man using it to hang a picture frame, a woman drilling a hole for a plant hook.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Whether you're hanging a picture frame, putting up a shelf, or tackling a major construction task, our electric drill is ready to assist.\\\"\\n\\n[Show a comparison between the electric drill and a regular drill.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Say goodbye to the struggle and strain of manual drills. With our electric drill, you get effortless, consistent power at your fingertips.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of the drill, then pull back to reveal a man proudly admiring a completed project.]\\n\\nVO: \\\"Efficiency, power, precision - bring your projects to life faster and easier with our electric drill.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black, and then the brand logo and product name