day.\\n\\n[End of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 448}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720218195, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hlchlJkZQFYmGoSrcUA3zs2XDdnQ\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot: A peaceful nursery room with soft, gentle music playing in the background]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Every parent knows, a happy baby means a happy home.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of a baby sleeping peacefully]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"And nothing keeps your little ones as comfortable and dry as our Premium Soft Nappies.\\\"\\n\\n[The scene shifts to a bundle of nappies being taken from the packet.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Our nappies are designed with your baby's comfort in mind.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a demonstration of the nappy\\u2019s features: Ultra-absorbency, stretchy sides, and a soft inner lining]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Featuring ultra-absorbency to keep your baby dry, stretchy sides for a perfect fit, and a soft inner lining to protect your baby's delicate skin.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a scene of a mother easily changing her baby's nappy, the baby giggling]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"And we haven\\u2019t forgotten about you, parents. Our nappies are easy to use, making changes quick and fuss-free.\\\"\\n\\n[The scene shifts to the nappies being available in different sizes.]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Available in a range of sizes, our nappies grow as they do.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a sequence of happy babies playing, sleeping, and laughing]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"So, you can focus on the precious moments that truly matter.\\\"\\n\\n[The scene shifts to the product shot of the nappies pack with the brand name and logo]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Keep your baby happy and dry with our Premium Soft Nappies.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the product\\u2019s tagline]\\n\\nTEXT ON SCREEN: \\\"Premium Soft Nappies - For happy babies and even happier parents.\\\"\\n\\n[End of the advert with cheerful music fading out]\\n\\nNARRATOR (V.O): \\\"Premium Soft Nappies, caring for your baby, one nappy at a time.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 425}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720218211, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hlcxda9DJEFwSvxTMFaWRW0L9RWr\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a science museum\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: A young boy looking through a telescope. The camera angle changes to show he\\u2019s looking at a picture of a galaxy in a museum]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cEver wondered what lies beyond our world?\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene change: A little girl looks in awe at a life-size dinosaur skeleton]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cOr travelled back in time to walk with dinosaurs?\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene change: A group of kids gather around an interactive exhibit, laughing and having fun]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cAt the [Name] Science Museum, we open doors to worlds you've only dreamed of.\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene change: Panoramic view of the museum filled with families]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cWe are a hub of discovery, a playground for the inquisitive, a sanctuary for the curious.\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene change: An exciting demonstration at the museum's live science show]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cEnjoy live science shows that dazzle, interactive exhibits that spark curiosity, and hands-on activities that make learning fun.\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene change: A family enjoying a 3D movie at the museum's IMAX cinema]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cExperience the wonders of the universe in our state-of-the-art IMAX cinema.\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene change: A couple enjoying a quiet moment at a cafe in the museum]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cAnd when you need to refuel, our onsite caf\\u00e9 serves delicious snacks and refreshing beverages.\\u201d\\n\\n[Scene change: A group of kids leaving the museum, looking happy and excited]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\u201cAt the [Name] 