goodbye to stubborn stains and hello to spotless shine with UltraClean Dishwasher Tablets!\\n\\n[Switch to a shot of the dishwasher tablets. They're brightly colored, fizzing and bubbling as they dissolve in water.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\nWith UltraClean, you get the ultimate cleaning power. Our tablets are specially formulated with a fast-dissolving technology to break down even the toughest food residues.\\n\\n[Cut to a sequence of before and after shots of dirty dishes becoming sparkling clean.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\nStuck-on lasagna? Not a problem. Burnt-on cheese? Piece of cake. UltraClean Dishwasher Tablets work hard so you don't have to.\\n\\n[Switch to a shot of the dishwasher door opening, revealing perfectly clean dishes.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\nJust pop one in, sit back, and let UltraClean do the rest. The result? Dishes so clean, they sparkle!\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the product package.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\nUltraClean Dishwasher Tablets. Tough on stains, gentle on your dishes. \\n\\n[The scene transitions to a happy family at a dinner table enjoying a meal.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\nSo you can enjoy more precious moments with your family without worrying about the cleanup.\\n\\n[The commercial ends with the product logo, tagline, and a call to action.]\\n\\nVOICEOVER: \\nUltraClean Dishwasher Tablets - For a clean that shines. Get yours at a store near you today!\\n\\n[Screen fades to black, end of advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 346}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720218557, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hliXVBQcn3Ni2Bm6BEK0vNvMv3G9\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a vacuum cleaner\", \"response\": \"[Upbeat music playing]\\n\\n[Scene opens to a family room, kids playing, laughter, and a dog running around. Suddenly, the dog knocks over a flower pot, soil scattering on the carpet.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Life is full of unexpected messes. But don't worry. We've got you covered.\\\"\\n\\n[A quick transition