 to a sequence of shots showing people of different ages, sizes, and genders lifting weights, high-fiving each other, and celebrating their achievements.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"This is a class for everyone. No matter your age, size, or fitness level, we believe in the strength within you.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the trainer enthusiastically explaining a technique to a group of attentive students.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Our trainers work closely with you to ensure you're using proper technique, maximizing your results while minimizing your risk of injury.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a woman struggling to lift a weight, then succeeding with a smile. The class cheers her on.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"At PowerFlex, we celebrate progress, no matter how small. Every lift is a victory.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a sequence of shots showing the class doing different exercises, supporting each other, and having fun.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Join us for a fun, challenging, and rewarding workout experience. Get stronger. Get healthier. Get happier.\\\"\\n\\n[Closing shot: The PowerFlex logo appears on the screen.]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"PowerFlex Weightlifting Class. Where your strength is our success.\\\"\\n\\n[Screen fades to black, with contact details and class schedule appearing on the screen.]\\n\\nText on Screen: \\\"Book your class today at www.powerflex.com or call us at 555-123-4567\\\"\\n\\n[End of advert]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4-0613\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 424}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720218765, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hllt88oPrjOiuJrLuFndl6r6YA5H\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\", \"response\": \"[Opening scene: A beautiful sunrise over a lush green golf course. Slow, tranquil music begins to play. The camera pans to show a close-up of a golf club striking a ball]\\n\\nNarrator (Voiceover): \\\"Introducing the ProStrike 3000, the golf club designed for champions.\\\" \\n\\n[Cut t